cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this evaluation suite in research, please cite it."
title: "ResearchClawEval Arena — Evaluation Suite for Research-Agent Frameworks"
abstract: >-
  Public evaluation protocol for research-agent frameworks on three real
  scientific tasks (TDC-ADMET-Tox, PsyDefDetect, ARC-WBE-2026): frozen task
  contracts, official-scorer glue, dataset setup with sha256 verification,
  submission templates, and a long-term community-leaderboard metric system.
  No datasets are redistributed; no results are published with the protocol.
authors:
  - name: ResearchClawEval Arena contributors
keywords:
  - research-agent
  - evaluation
  - benchmark
  - shared task
  - LLM judge
date-released: "2026-10-20"
license: MIT